{"t":"024110.KS","n":"Industrial Bank of Korea","nKo":"기업은행","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":18970.0,"chg":690.0,"chgPct":0.03775,"prev":18280.0,"dayH":18970.0,"dayL":18190.0,"w52H":29550.0,"w52L":18190.0,"vol":892196,"avgVol":667288,"mcap":15127168417792,"pe":null,"fpe":5.23,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":1258.0,"divY":0.0688,"beta":null,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Financial Services","sKo":"금융 서비스","i":"Banks - Regional","iKo":"은행 - 지역","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.ibk.co.kr","sum":"Industrial Bank of Korea operates as a small and medium-sized enterprise (SME) financing bank in Korea and internationally. It provides personal and corporate banking, such as check, transfer, deposit/trust, fund, insurance, credit card, loan, forex, dues, check/draft, information management, retirement pension, and B2B; and provides various financial products and services, including personal and corporate product mail, product guide and tree; smart finance; banking, product, and affiliate services; and customer preferential service, as well as financial information for corporate management support, legal support, stock, real estate, and auction/public auction. The company also offers card information/application, card finance loan, My card management, personal and corporate card services,","sumKo":"기업은행은 국내외 중소기업 금융은행으로 활동하고 있습니다. 수표, 이체, 예금/신탁, 펀드, 보험, 신용카드, 대출, 외환, 회비, 수표/환어음, 정보관리, 퇴직연금, B2B 등 개인 및 기업 금융 서비스를 제공합니다. 개인 및 기업 상품메일, 상품안내, 트리 등 다양한 금융상품 및 서비스를 제공합니다. 스마트금융; 은행, 상품, 제휴 서비스; 고객 우대 서비스는 물론 기업경영지원, 법률지원, 주식, 부동산, 경매/공매 등 금융정보를 제공합니다. 또한, 카드정보/신청, 카드금융대출, 마이카드 관리, 개인 및 법인카드 서비스 등도 제공하고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":8186940000000,"ni":2796469790000},{"y":2023,"rev":8575300000000,"ni":2669700000000},{"y":2024,"rev":8134000000000,"ni":2673820300000},{"y":2025,"rev":8565500000000,"ni":2711100000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2188300000000,"ni":462500000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":